4-602.13 The following non-food contact surfaces were observed to be soiled:
1) counter under/behind frozen drink and ice cream machines (dust/general buildup);
2) syrup storage cabinet beneath frozen drink machine (syrup splash);
3) coffee counter under/behind all equipment (dust/general buildup);  and
4) cabinet below soda machine - especially in and around the drain (mold/general buildup).
Nonfood contact surfaces shall be cleaned at a frequency necessary to eliminate buildup of grease, food splash and general debris.
